# ==============================================================================
# Git 换行符与属性规范配置 (.gitattributes)
# 强制全平台 (Windows / macOS / Linux / Android) 统一使用 LF (Line Feed)
# ==============================================================================

# 默认全局配置：所有文本文件检出和提交时均强制使用 LF 换行符
* text=auto eol=lf

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Godot 核心脚本与场景资源 (强制 LF)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.gd text eol=lf
*.tscn text eol=lf
*.tres text eol=lf
*.godot text eol=lf
*.uid text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.shader text eol=lf
*.gdshader text eol=lf

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 数据与文档文件 (强制 LF)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.json text eol=lf
*.spec text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.po text eol=lf
*.pot text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 二进制资产与媒体文件 (保持二进制完整性，禁止任何换行符转换)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.ase binary
*.aseprite binary

*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary

*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

*.import binary
*.pck binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary
